<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz October unemployment unchanged at 4.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz October unemployment unchanged at 4.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people registered as unemployed in Kyrgyzstan in October totalled 4.5 percent of the workforce -- virtually unchanged from the previous month, the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p> KYRGYZ UNEMPLOYMENT	  Oct 96   Sep 96   Oct 95</p>
<p> number unemployed	    78,300   78,600   43,000</p>
<p> percentage of workforce     4.5	4.5	2.5</p>
<p>NOTES - The figures are for those officially registered as unemployed in the Central Asian nation of 4.5 million.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
